1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:02,120
Hi, I'm Dr. Dickson.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,620
If you're looking for a new dentist, I know
you have a lot of choices.

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:09,600
And if you're like many of the patients who
come to see us, you're probably

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,700
looking for more than someone to simply
clean your teeth or fix a problem.

5
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,400
You want a dental office where you feel
comfortable.

6
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,220
You want a team that listens.

7
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,460
You want recommendations you can trust.

8
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:24,640
And you want to know that the people caring
for you genuinely have your best

9
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,300
interests at heart.

10
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,900
That's exactly the type of practice we've
worked hard to create.

11
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:33,480
Our philosophy is simple, treat every
patient the way we would want our own

12
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:38,020
family treated. That means taking the time
to get to know you, understand your

13
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:42,360
goals, answer your questions, and help you
make confident decisions about your

14
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:46,160
health. We don't believe in rushing people
through appointments, we don't

15
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:49,740
believe in pressuring patients into
treatment, and we don't believe that

16
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:52,160
great dentistry is just about fixing teeth.

17
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:56,880
We believe it's about helping people improve
their health, their confidence,

18
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,540
and their quality of life.

19
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:02,720
When you visit our office, you'll find a
team that genuinely cares about your

20
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,800
experience from the moment you walk through
our doors.

21
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:09,040
We want you to feel welcomed, respected, and
supported every step of the way.

22
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:11,760
We also believe that patients deserve
clarity.

23
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:15,740
That's why we take the time to explain what
we're seeing, discuss your options,

24
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:19,500
and help you understand the why behind every
recommendation we make.

25
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:23,480
Whether you're coming in for a routine
cleaning, have concerns about your

26
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:27,340
dental health, or you're interested in
improving your smile, our goal is always

27
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:32,000
the same, to help you feel informed,
comfortable, and confident in your care.

28
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:35,500
Thank you for taking the time to learn a
little more about our practice.

29
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:39,320
My team and I would be honored to care for
you, and we look forward to meeting

30
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:39,840
you soon.
